%% Billing — a buyer asks for money back, and the seller decides once.
flowchart TD
  A[Buyer opens their order] --> B{Paid by cash, cheque, e-Transfer or credit,\nand nothing already waiting?}
  B -- no --> X[No way to ask: the order shows nothing to request]
  B -- yes --> C[RefundRequests::Create: status pending]
  C --> D[Notify buyer and the people who manage billing]
  C --> W[Buyer may withdraw: status cancelled]
  D --> E{Steward decides, once}
  E -- decline with a reply --> F[status declined, nothing given back]
  E -- approve all or part --> G[Refunds::Record against each local payment,\nnewest first, one key per payment]
  G --> H[Tax pro-rated, credit reversed, order settled]
  H --> I[status approved or partially_approved]
  F --> J[Notify buyer: reply on the order page]
  I --> J
